-- Magna Carta (1215), English translation in McKechnie 1905: CHAPTERS 2 TO 8.
-- The heir's relief (2), the heir freed of relief on coming of age (3), the guardian of
-- a minor heir's land (4, 5), the heir's marriage (6) and the widow (7, 8).
