-- "Terms the text does not define"): relief, earl, baron, knight's fee, military service,
-- in chief, wardship, full age, disparagement, dower, marriage portion, security.
-- Where the text names no one who bears a duty (chapters 6, 7, 8) the rule is a decision
-- function and not a regulative rule (forks F6, F7, F8).
