GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
DECIDE `ch 5 -- the guardian shall keep up the houses, parks, fishponds, mills and other things out of the issues of the land` IS
    PARTY `a guardian`
    MUST `keep up the houses, parks, places for live-stock, fishponds, mills and other things pertaining to the land`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `a guardian` BECAUSE "ch 5: the guardian did not keep up the houses, parks, fishponds, mills and other things pertaining to the land"

