@ref Chapter 5 clause 5.2 (src:17)
GIVEN `the heir has come to full age` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party Act
DECIDE `ch 5 -- the guardian shall restore the land to the heir who has come to full age` IS
    IF `the heir has come to full age`
    THEN PARTY `a guardian`
         MUST `restore to the heir all his land, stocked with ploughs and implements of husbandry`
