         LEST BREACH BY `a guardian` BECAUSE "ch 5: the guardian did not restore all the land, stocked with ploughs and implements of husbandry"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- gloss (not the text's): the last limb is a judgment the text leaves open ("according as
-- the season of husbandry shall require, and the issues of the land can reasonably bear"),
